1
00:00:00,878 --> 00:00:03,588
(Howard:)All systems go,
if you catch my drift. Heh.

2
00:00:04,381 --> 00:00:07,221
(Bernadette:)I always catch your drift.

3
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:10,090
(Howard:)Well, something's obviously
bugging you.

4
00:00:10,262 --> 00:00:11,302
(Howard:)What is it?

5
00:00:11,972 --> 00:00:15,512
I can't believe you signed up for
the space program without talking to me.

6
00:00:17,644 --> 00:00:20,854
I get it. We...
You're worried about me.

7
00:00:21,565 --> 00:00:28,075
(Howard:)That is so sweet. You know,
there's a saying we have at NASA.

8
00:00:30,616 --> 00:00:36,366
(Howard:)What makes the right stuff so right
is that it always comes home.

9
00:00:37,956 --> 00:00:40,166
(Bernadette:)Just stop talking, Howard.

10
00:00:41,627 --> 00:00:43,417
(Howard:)This isn't the reaction I expected...

11
00:00:43,587 --> 00:00:46,257
(Howard:)...when I told you
I was gonna be an astronaut.

12
00:00:46,423 --> 00:00:48,553
What did you think was gonna happen?

13
00:00:48,717 --> 00:00:51,177
Honestly? Sex, heh.

14
00:00:53,096 --> 00:00:55,806
(Leonard:)- Howard.
- Do you realize what a big deal this is?

15
00:00:55,974 --> 00:01:00,024
What an honor it is
to be chosen to go into space?

